{"ticker":"XYZ","updated":"2026-10-30T23:24:17Z","profile":{"longName":"Block, Inc.","shortName":"Block, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.block.xyz","fullTimeEmployees":10205,"marketCap":45792595968,"trailingPE":136.10715,"forwardPE":14.6388035,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8286344,"pegRatio":0.59,"targetMeanPrice":97.91119,"targetHighPrice":125.0,"targetLowPrice":75.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":42,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.093,"earningsGrowth":-0.833,"grossMargins":0.46572,"operatingMargins":0.06999,"profitMargins":0.01426,"totalRevenue":25041963008,"beta":2.553,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":86.92,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":48.21,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Block, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, builds ecosystems focused on commerce and financial products and services in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments: Square and Cash App. The Square segment offers managed payment services; software solutions; hardware products, such as registers, terminals, stands, and readers for contactless and chips; banking services consisting of lending, instant transfer, and checking and savings accounts; and full-service setup and support services. This segment also provides loyalty, marketing, team management, and payroll services; and gift cards. It also offers Square Handheld, a portable point-of sale device for transaction purposes. The Cash App segment offers financial tools, including peer-to-peer payments, bitcoin, and stock investment brokerage; Cash App Card, a debit card; Cash App Pay, mobile-friendly way for cash app customers to pay at merchants across online and in-person channels; direct deposit, stock brokerage, and tax preparation services; and Afterpay, a buy now, pay later platform. In addition, the company operates TIDAL, a platform for musicians and fans; TBD, an open developer platform focused on making the decentralized financial world accessible; Bitkey, a self-custody bitcoin wallet; and proto. The company was formerly known as Square, Inc. and changed its name to Block, Inc. in Decembe","summary_zh":"Block, Inc. 及其子公司在美國和國際上建立了專注於商業和金融產品及服務的生態系統。它透過兩個部門運作：Square 和 Cash App。 Square 部門提供託管支付服務；軟體解決方案；硬體產品，例如非接觸式和晶片的收銀機、終端、支架和讀卡器；銀行服務包括貸款、即時轉帳、支票和儲蓄帳戶；以及全方位服務設定和支援服務。該部門還提供忠誠度、行銷、團隊管理和薪資服務；和禮品卡。它還提供 Square Handheld，這是一種用於交易目的的便攜式銷售點設備。現金應用程式部門提供金融工具，包括點對點支付、比特幣和股票投資經紀； Cash App Card，借記卡； Cash App Pay，現金應用程式客戶可以透過線上和麵對面管道在商家處進行支付的行動友善方式；直接存款、股票經紀和報稅服務； Afterpay，一個先買後付的平台。此外，該公司還經營 TIDAL，這是一個面向音樂家和粉絲的平台； TBD，一個開放的開發者平台，致力於讓去中心化的金融世界變得觸手可及； Bitkey，一個自我託管的比特幣錢包；和原型。該公司原名 Square, Inc.，於 12 月更名為 Block, Inc.","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":76.81,"h":77.1,"l":75.185,"c":76.23,"v":6813700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":76.3,"h":76.375,"l":75.34,"c":75.79,"v":4975000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":75.73,"h":75.96,"l":73.72,"c":75.75,"v":4804900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":76.3,"h":77.075,"l":73.69,"c":74.94,"v":4785800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":75.05,"h":75.98,"l":74.885,"c":75.82,"v":5191500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":75.63,"h":76.67,"l":75.0,"c":75.51,"v":4162300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":75.795,"h":76.79,"l":73.05,"c":73.75,"v":5756300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":73.94,"h":74.77,"l":73.446,"c":74.23,"v":4196700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":73.6,"h":74.215,"l":72.845,"c":72.87,"v":4621300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":73.33,"h":75.2,"l":73.1,"c":74.63,"v":6474800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":74.56,"h":75.96,"l":73.801,"c":75.78,"v":5512200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":75.88,"h":77.25,"l":74.53,"c":75.71,"v":5296900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.2,"h":78.3,"l":75.76,"c":77.37,"v":5443800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":77.7,"h":77.71,"l":76.17,"c":77.03,"v":7600300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":76.5,"h":77.69,"l":74.72,"c":77.41,"v":9005300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":77.69,"h":79.0,"l":75.48,"c":76.54,"v":7218100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":76.23,"h":78.41,"l":75.99,"c":76.49,"v":5065800},{"t":"202